# NAME: Copilot
# PURPOSE: GitHub Copilot transport and telemetry only
# NOTE: github.com itself remains in the GitHub rule group; do not capture all GitHub traffic here.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot-proxy.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,origin-tracker.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot-telemetry.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot-reports.github.com
